OL,3,APolice pass Mohamed Al Fayed case file
OL,4,Ato prosecutors
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police have sent a
OL,7,Ffile of evidence to the Crown
OL,8,FProsecution Service (CPS) relating to a
OL,9,Fman in his 80s as part of its
OL,10,Finvestigation into claims of sexual
OL,11,Fassault against Mohamed Al Fayed.
OL,13,FA man and a woman, both in their 80s,
OL,14,Fwere interviewed under caution last
OL,15,Fmonth on suspicion of aiding and
OL,16,Fabetting rape and sexual assault, and
OL,17,Fassisting the commission of sexual
OL,18,Foffences.
OL,20,FThe CPS will now decide whether a
OL,21,Fcharge can be made.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
