OL,3,APolice pass Mohamed Al Fayed case file
OL,4,Ato prosecutors
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, three women, aged in
OL,7,Ftheir 40s, 50s and 60s, and one man in
OL,8,Fhis 60s were also questioned. The
OL,9,Fformer Harrods owner died three years
OL,10,Fago aged 94 having never faced any
OL,11,Fcharges.
